    "source": "owner core box 2026-09-10 (S 13–19 · O 1–4 · C 0.5–1.4 wt%) and owner declaration 2026-09-20 (box_ceiling)",
    "counter_evidence_searched": "C107 (interior-core.md): with this box the layered family's core is not reached; the two box corners give S 18.9062 (floor) against 13.8438 wt% (ceiling) at halvings 6, so the choice of corner is a declaration. Huang+ 2023's fit range (19 GPa anchor) is the box; no source held gives Mars's O or C.\n"
